| File | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `~/.claude/commands/{{WF}}.md` | Phase 1 — plan (gated, read-only). |
| `~/.claude/commands/{{WF}}-execute.md` | Phase 2 — execute (autonomous). |
| `~/.claude/agents/{{WF}}-planner.md` | Read-only discovery (plan mode). |
